## Performance Optimization

### Eager Loading

Always eager load relationships to prevent N+1 queries:

```php
protected function getEventsQuery()
{
    return parent::getEventsQuery()
        ->with([
            'patient',
            'doctor.user',
            'clinic',
            'status',
            'service'
        ]);
}
```

